    "answer": "Confabulation in generative AI is the production of confidently stated but erroneous or false content in response to prompts. It includes outputs that diverge from the input or contradict earlier statements, and is colloquially called “hallucinations” or “fabrications” [C1][C3]. This phenomenon can mislead or deceive users by presenting inaccurate information as fact.",
